OL,3,GNEWSAMan admits unlawfully killing
OL,4,AKaren Cummings
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man has admitted to the unlawful
OL,7,Fkilling of children's nurse Karen
OL,8,FCummings.
OL,10,FKevin McGuigan Jnr, aged 44, admitted
OL,11,Fthe charges in Belfast Crown Court on
OL,12,FTuesday.
OL,14,FKaren Cummings, who worked in Daisy
OL,15,FHill Hospital in Newry, was found
OL,16,Funconscious with a serious head injury
OL,17,Fin Laurel Heights in Banbridge, County
OL,18,FDown in December 2024.
OL,20,FThe emergency services attended the
OL,21,Fscene but she was pronounced dead a
OL,22,Fshort time later.
OL,23,APub: 17-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
